# Arguments of the second couli vmalert (B1-25c; D10-2622), one -flag=value per line. It evaluates
# only rules/outage.yaml, reads the same node VictoriaMetrics and notifies the same couli
# Alertmanager as the couli vmalert (couli.args); its own listener (8881 is the couli vmalert's).
# 30s is below every for: of outage.yaml (1m / 2m).
-rule=/opt/couli/alerting/rules/outage.yaml
-datasource.url=http://127.0.0.1:8428
-remoteRead.url=http://127.0.0.1:8428
-remoteWrite.url=http://127.0.0.1:8428
-notifier.url=http://127.0.0.1:9093
-evaluationInterval=30s
-httpListenAddr=127.0.0.1:8882
